# Whole directory, not just *.log. The extension glob above leaves
# logs/foo.log.1, logs/foo.log.2026-11-17, logs/foo.out and logs/.gitkeep
# TRACKABLE on a public repo, so the first rotation would commit a log file.
# Service logs are deliberately written outside the tree
# (D:\Projects\_skill-extraction-ops\logs\, see run_annotation_stack.ps1);
# this rule is the belt-and-braces for anything that lands here anyway.
logs/

